@HappyHoliday_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294
@clientToken = paste-client-access-token-here
@managerToken = paste-manager-access-token-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-access-token-here
@premiseId = paste-premise-guid-here

### Register a client
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Holiday Client",
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "Client123!"
}

### Login (development manager: manager@happyholiday.local / Manager123!)
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@happyholiday.local",
  "password": "Manager123!"
}

### View the authenticated profile
GET {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Assigned client worklist
GET {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/users/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Admins can create another manager
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/auth/managers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Another Manager",
  "email": "manager2@example.com",
  "password": "Manager456!"
}

### Update client contact details
PUT {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Holiday Client",
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "phone": "+77001234567"
}

### Preview a future booking (change the dates if needed)
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/orders/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premiseId": "{{premiseId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T14:00:00+05:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-01T18:30:00+05:00",
  "guests": 50,
  "services": []
}

### Submit the booking
POST {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premiseId": "{{premiseId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T14:00:00+05:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-01T18:30:00+05:00",
  "guests": 50,
  "services": []
}

### Occupancy (UTC query avoids encoding + signs)
GET {{HappyHoliday_HostAddress}}/api/premises/occupancy?from=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-02T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
